  <item>
    <title>025. 有关人生的不确定性</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c1998bdde969cfdc61dcb4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c1998bdde969cfdc61dcb4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 06 Feb 2024 02:29:31 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhTIaBjLncEin1mOdpHliTOpeXmQ.PNG"></figure><span></span><p><span>久等了，《鸣翠柳FM》回归啦！2024， 你有什么期待，又有哪些随之而来的焦虑呢？第四季，我们用”人生中的不确定性”开篇，看看压力对于生活有什么作用，也谈到心理咨询师对于不确定性的独特视角，手拉手一起面对未来。 最后送上独家新年目标锦囊！</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期你会听到</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>1. yadi 初次转行就遭遇考学失败…</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. ruoya 日本生活初体验，老了十岁吧也就…</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 在过程中体会内在质地的变化，然后“放手”</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 因为太怕失败而不敢开始怎么破（回复听众留言）</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 如何提高对不确定感的适应能力</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. “你这是在跟我玩欲擒故纵吗？”</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. 今年我一定好好做计划</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo4rdVHCnG_dii-c9p41QsLZxNjL.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>延伸阅读</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://rightasrain.uwmedicine.org/mind/well-being/new-years-resolutions-that-work" data-url="https://rightasrain.uwmedicine.org/mind/well-being/new-years-resolutions-that-work"><span>How to Make New Year’s Resolutions That Actually Work</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mvwsy_Kauzk" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mvwsy_Kauzk"><span>lukrembo - morning rain</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>延伸信息</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>收听平台：小宇宙、苹果播客、爱发电、喜马拉雅、Spotify、Google podcast、Pocket Casts</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客国内服务区，需手动添加rss地址：</span><a href="https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml" data-url="https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml"><span>https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你的收听呀！我们很期待你的留言。如果你喜欢我们的播客，也请把我们分享给你身边的朋友，或在爱发电为我们的创作发电，鼓励我们持续的录制下去。</span></p>]]></description>
