  <item>
    <title>023. 《编舟记》：编辞典的究竟是语言学家or疯子？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64d047d2e490c5dee5bd1c1b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64d047d2e490c5dee5bd1c1b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Aug 2023 01:24:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhJH0G5TEr1LBmIjr7sF9xEAf8L3.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>很久没听到“谁谁谁是活字典”的表达了，是不是因为没有人喜欢翻字典了？但这并不代表它不重要。每一个字，每一个词条，都是由辞典编纂者悉心挑选出来的，编写过程可以长达十余年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>带着对辞典学的好奇和对作者们的敬佩，我们掏心窝子分享了各种学习外语的经验，还对中文使用里的“怪现象”用力吐槽。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期你会听到</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>1. 电影《编舟记》里辞典编著者的日常，字字皆辛苦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 最最最新的新华字典长这样~</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 方言乃魔法：用上海话学日本语啊，旁友！</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 《牛津非裔美国英语字典》，一种文化尊重。</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. &nbsp;一身多巴胺穿搭的45度人是什么人？</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. &nbsp;"。, ?" 都都蒸发啦？</span></p><span></span><p><span>7. &nbsp;学语言，要用字典吗？</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>《新华字典》第12版内页 ⬇️</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvsy-Mr5BRC9gLqf4FlQyPd2Gmhi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlH-7dEq1MV0AgYLD6jcK3OPjZDS.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>字典词典排排站，竭诚为您服务！</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlkDc7LDc4OIJxobbJxTwezz9keb.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>《ドラえもん はじめての国語辞典》第2版 一本非常卡哇伊的日本小学生字典，对初学日语的外国人来说也绰绰有余</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lsKZzwHOOnID19vjm-t-ADY4yMXr.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>除了查词，科普知识也从娃娃抓起</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loQVnOrdG3qp2rr_97VjOS-NGcgc.png"></figure><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>拓展阅读</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://movie.douban.com/subject/11500954/" data-url="https://movie.douban.com/subject/11500954/"><span>日本电影《编舟记》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/30459275/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/30459275/"><span>《新华字典》第12版</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/31738547/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/31738547/"><span>《新编学生字典》第2版</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.oed.com/information/using-the-oed/oed-event-recordings/the-oxford-dictionary-of-african-american-english/the-oxford-dictionary-of-african-american-english-the-first-100-words/?tl=true" data-url="https://www.oed.com/information/using-the-oed/oed-event-recordings/the-oxford-dictionary-of-african-american-english/the-oxford-dictionary-of-african-american-english-the-first-100-words/?tl=true"><span>牛津非裔美国英语字典</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.shogakukan.co.jp/pr/dorajiten/index_pc.html" data-url="https://www.shogakukan.co.jp/pr/dorajiten/index_pc.html"><span>ドラえもん　はじめての国語辞典</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://animaniacs.fandom.com/wiki/All_The_Words_in_the_English_Language" data-url="https://animaniacs.fandom.com/wiki/All_The_Words_in_the_English_Language"><span>All The Words in the English Language</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>延伸信息</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>收听平台：小宇宙、苹果播客、爱发电、喜马拉雅、Spotify、Google podcast、Pocket Casts</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客国内服务区，需手动添加rss地址：</span><a href="https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml" data-url="https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml"><span>https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你的收听呀！我们很期待你的留言。如果你喜欢我们的播客，也请把我们分享给你身边的朋友，或在爱发电为我们的创作发电，鼓励我们持续的录制下去。</span></p>]]></description>
