  <item>
    <title>022. 对话心理咨询师：观察心中飘过的云，用正念瓦解日常之苦</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64a441f263a61044f43d6389</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64a441f263a61044f43d6389</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Jul 2023 15:59:46 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsQCAIrgTRKitG4ww4HlK7dNhsbY.png"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>温馨提示：本期结尾的小彩蛋，也可以躺着听哦</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>你接触过正念吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>你最近常感到焦虑、担忧、内耗、疲惫吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>还记得最近一次感受到平静是什么时候吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们和心理咨询师莫川一起聊聊正念。当确定性日渐稀薄，正念是如何帮助我们安住当下，检视已不再适用的固有思维，进而瓦解日常之苦的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢本期内容，也可以收听相关往期节目 ：</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/623d3c2706bdd096c372032d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/623d3c2706bdd096c372032d"><span>一日哲学：即使跌入谷底，我只疗愈今天</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>本期你会听到</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>1. 正念 = 冥想吗？关于正念的常见误解</span></p><span></span><p><span>2. 很忙！一边录节目、一边做身体扫描</span></p><span></span><p><span>3. 精进：从灾难性思维、和固有情绪反应中解放</span></p><span></span><p><span>4. 穿越时空的创伤经验：辨识此刻的情绪，是否来自于当下</span></p><span></span><p><span>5. 变化：没有不会消失的痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span>6. 面对不同来访者，心理咨询师能保持正念吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>7. 冥想app使用心得</span></p><span></span><p><span>8. 彩蛋：观呼吸冥想练习</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>拓展阅读</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://book.douban.com/subject/2277299/" data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/2277299/"><span>《当下的力量》</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LQ4y1m7SD/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=6095a8305a05619114de82d4b52af294" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1LQ4y1m7SD/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=6095a8305a05619114de82d4b52af294"><span>《Headspace冥想正指南》第一季</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.masterclass.com/classes/jon-kabat-zinn-teaches-mindfulness-and-meditation" data-url="https://www.masterclass.com/classes/jon-kabat-zinn-teaches-mindfulness-and-meditation"><span>乔.卡巴金 教正念冥想大师课</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>冥想app：罐头冥想、Headspace</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾莫川的公众号：乐吾解忧</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>音乐</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xjSxWMbz_FQ" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xjSxWMbz_FQ"><span><wine> &nbsp;Lukrembo&nbsp;</wine></span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8XjNOC8zZas" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8XjNOC8zZas"><span>&nbsp;<wait for="" you=""> Kurt Stewart&nbsp;</wait></span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ihq64W33cyo" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ihq64W33cyo"><span>〈I Will Be Grateful〉Primalhouse Music</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>延伸信息</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>收听平台：小宇宙、苹果播客、爱发电、喜马拉雅、Spotify、Google podcast、Pocket Casts</span></p><span></span><p><span>苹果播客国内服务区，需手动添加rss地址：</span><a href="https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml" data-url="https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml"><span>https://mclfm.typlog.io/feed/audio.xml</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢你的收听呀！我们很期待你的留言。如果你喜欢我们的播客，也请把我们分享给你身边的朋友，或在爱发电为我们的创作发电，鼓励我们持续的录制下去。</span></p>]]></description>
