    <guid isPermaLink="false">625fc588226c1e4d9c9884b3</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Apr 2022 10:49:56 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><img src="http://imagev2.xmcdn.com/storages/60ae-audiofreehighqps/8D/DC/GMCoOSEGNab8AArIhwE_8uwj.jpg!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><blockquote><strong><span>本期完整Show Notes请移步评论区、微信公共账号查看</span></strong></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>节目时间戳</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>PART 1 &nbsp;居家日常</span></p><span></span><p><span>PART2春光</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> &nbsp;居家太久，小区遇到蛇觉得好饿</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a>本期彩蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1145">19:05</a>离奇消失的蜜蜂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a>花为什么是美的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a>人类对大自然性别的主观解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a> 郁金香的美，是因为感染某种病毒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2069">34:29</a>巴掌大的厨房里也能亲近自然</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2210">36:50</a>向绿化带进攻：挖野菜吃野花</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>拓展阅读</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>《植物的欲望》【美】迈克.波伦</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>「本期音乐」</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/60ec3064333d36c01dd03ee6/625fc588226c1e4d9c9884b3/Link%20:%20https://youtu.be/XIhyti2Qa74" data-url="https://podcaster.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcasts/60ec3064333d36c01dd03ee6/625fc588226c1e4d9c9884b3/Link%20:%20https://youtu.be/XIhyti2Qa74"><span>Rose (Prod. by Lukrembo)</span></a></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>延伸信息</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>收听平台：小宇宙、苹果播客、爱发电、喜马拉雅、Spotify、Google podcast、Pocket Casts</span></p>